WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:12.340
Document requests: document applications: each request, the list of documents the customer must send and each one's status. Customers upload through a secure link.

2
00:00:12.889 --> 00:00:18.110
Click "New application" and choose the checklist; the secure link is sent in the chat.

3
00:00:18.657 --> 00:00:25.000
Open an application to see what has arrived and what's missing; move it on with "Change status".

4
00:00:25.548 --> 00:00:31.810
Hand over the result (visa, translation…) encrypted with "Deliver a file".

5
00:00:32.361 --> 00:00:40.320
When the job is done, remove the files with "Delete all files"; keeping documents longer than needed is a risk.
